              <h3 class="rts-section-title">
               Non-Statutory Committees
              </h3>
              <p>
                These college-level committees enable inclusive governance,
                student welfare, research ethics and quality assurance. Each
                committee meets at the frequency required by its terms of
                reference and reports to the Principal.
              </p>
            </div>

